Third-party Java dependencies used by bartMachine
==================================================

The bartMachine package does not bundle the Java libraries listed below.
They are distributed by the required companion package bartMachineJARs and
retain their respective upstream licenses:

- commons-math-2.1.jar: Apache Commons Math 2.1, Apache License 2.0
- fastutil-core-8.5.18.jar: fastutil 8.5.18, Apache License 2.0
- trove-3.0.3.jar: GNU Trove 3.0.3, GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1

The authoritative notices, upstream project and source links, and license
locations are installed with bartMachineJARs. They can be found from R with:

    system.file("COPYRIGHTS", package = "bartMachineJARs")
